<title>USA: Fannie Mae increases REMIC 1997-22.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae increases REMIC 1997-22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Thursday said is added about $148 million to a previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-22, issued via Salomon Inc, was increased to about $1.026 billion from approximately $878 million, the agency said.</p>
<p>The issue is backed by 30-year, 8.0 percent mortgage-backed certificates and various FNMA REMIC tranches, Fannie Mae said. It has a new settlement date of March 27.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
